   "lang": "python",
   "title": "jwt_checklist.py — verify like a server, not like a fan (complete, runnable)",
   "code": "import base64, json\n\ndef b64d(s):\n    return json.loads(base64.urlsafe_b64decode(s + '=' * (-len(s) % 4)))\n\ndef checklist(jwt_header, claims, now, expected_aud):\n    problems = []\n    if jwt_header.get('alg') not in ('RS256', 'ES256'):\n        problems.append(f\"alg not pinned/allowed: {jwt_header.get('alg')}\")\n    if claims.get('exp', 0) <= now:\n        problems.append('token expired')\n    if claims.get('aud') != expected_aud:\n        problems.append('audience mismatch — token minted for another API')\n    if not claims.get('sub'):\n        problems.append('no subject')\n    return problems or ['header+claims pass (signature verified by the library call you must never skip)']\n\nprint(checklist({'alg': 'none'}, {'exp': 1, 'aud': 'other', 'sub': 'u1'}, 100, 'lab-api'))",
   "output": "['alg not pinned/allowed: none', 'token expired', 'audience mismatch — token minted for another API']\n(The alg=none token from ctf-jwt fails three checks before signature is even discussed.)",
